{"version":1,"content":"<p>世界心臟病學大會當地時間10日在巴西里約熱內盧閉幕。</p><p>在本次會議上，世界心臟聯盟公布，中國科學院院士、復旦大學附屬中山醫院心內科主任葛均波當選該機構候任主席（2027年-2028年）。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-11T07:49:12.352607+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":92,"images":0,"source":"明報 中國","fallback":"rss-blocked"},"published_at":"2026-10-11T07:17:06+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-12T08:37:42.910727+00:00","content_updated_at":null,"content_hash":"7e8b48adf6764084f0543a6479eafb7809f3003f4f7f35807718e520981005d9","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null}